Infect combo-aggro: land a single unblockable infect creature (Glistener Elf, Blighted Agent) and kill in one big turn with pump spells (Invigorate, Berserk, Might of Old Krosa, Vines of Vastwood) — 10 poison ends the game, so you often win from nowhere. Protect the creature with Vines/Force of Will and only commit pump when it connects. Brainstorm/Ponder find the pieces. Do NOT overextend into removal; one protected hit is lethal.
